   "locked": false,
   "text": "Quick prompts cover the six jobs. \"Argue\nthe other side\" is the guard against\nanchoring on whatever the assistant said\nfirst.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Quick prompts cover the six jobs. \"Argue\nthe other side\" is the guard against\nanchoring on whatever the assistant said\nfirst.",
